# Task 150-012: Telegram Connector — Execution Plan

## Assessment
All three deliverables already exist from a prior sprint attempt:
1. `src/connectors/telegram.ts` — TelegramConnector class (112 LoC)
2. `tests/connectors/telegram.test.ts` — 6 test cases (5 required + 1 bonus)
3. `package.json` — telegraf ^4.16.0 dependency present

## Approach
1. Verify existing code quality against task spec
2. Run `tsc --noEmit` to confirm type safety
3. Run `npx vitest run tests/connectors/telegram.test.ts` to confirm all tests pass
4. Fix any issues found
5. Write .result file

## Key Design Decisions (already implemented)
- Dynamic import of telegraf (avoids hard dep at import time)
- Constructor injection of TelegrafClass for testing (no vi.mock needed)
- Minimal Telegraf type surface (interface-only, no telegraf import in types)
- BaseConnector lifecycle integration (super.start/super.stop calls)
